# escalation-citation reads the validator under test and, through cp -R of its directory (the
# mutant batteries copy the whole scripts dir so siblings resolve), every file beside it, so
# core/scripts/ is declared whole. The validator is the REQUIRED input; the other scripts are
# only copied. Its own directory is copied by the runner without being named.
# reason: core/scripts/ is copied whole -- cp -R "$EN_SRC_DIR" / "$FL_SRC_DIR" (the validator's own directory), core/fixtures/escalation-citation/run.sh:565, :683, :845.
core/scripts/
!core/scripts/validate-escalation-resolution.sh
